Set whether to read as newline-delimited JSON.

When `true` (default), expects newline-delimited JSON (NDJSON):
```text
{"key1": 1, "key2": "val"}
{"key1": 2, "key2": "vals"}
```

When `false`, expects JSON array format:
```text
[
  {"key1": 1, "key2": "val"},
  {"key1": 2, "key2": "vals"}
]
```

